Subject: [PATCH] mulligan registry + MulliganSteer + chooseMulligan hook

New AI-module score classes MulliganRegistry + MulliganSteer (the driver
quad's 5th dimension: the opening-hand keep/ship decision), keyed by the
stable playerId; strict no-op for unregistered seats. ComputerPlayer.
chooseMulligan consults the registry on the REAL pre-game decision only
(!game.isSimulation(), after the full-hand/test/Momir guards) and emits a
DRIVER_MULLIGAN marker; an unregistered seat falls through to the UNCHANGED
CP7 land heuristic (byte-identical prior behavior).
